  • Rebuild semantics and proof from clean sources; run every positive claim
  • Audit claim adequacy and real-program pinning
  • Inventory and assess every semantic and proof rule
  • Create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation
  • Account for proven versus assumed facts and write REVIEW.md verdict
